AutocompleteList.description:
The scrollable list. With a block that takes an argument it maps over the root's items (Appica's render function); otherwise it renders static children.

  AutocompleteList { |item| AutocompleteItem(value: item) { item } }
  AutocompleteList { AutocompleteItem(value: "Remix") { "Remix" } }

